      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study has been done in a Thermal Army Hospital, concerning the suffering of amputed persons and their treatment by \"tiapride\". For 20 observations, it has been noted 11 excellent and 6 good results, by a mean treatment of 300 mg. Interesting results are particularly observed at the first appearance of the soreness, a better integration of this one has been proved, it has also been noticed that amputed patients tolerate much better their prosthesis."},
